    description: Some("Your Baja Bugger barrels down a zig-zagging course that scrolls in from the top of the screen, where pick-up trucks and wedge cars kill on contact — so you jump and land on their roofs for points instead. Collect all eight flags to reach the next, harder road; misjudge a jump and come down off the track, and a buggy is gone."),
